---
layout: default
subject: Your subscription invoice
---
<p>Hello {{name}},</p>
<p>Your <strong>{{plan}}</strong> subscription renewed for {{period_start}} – {{period_end}}. Invoice <strong>{{invoice_number}}</strong> is due on {{due_date}}.</p>
<p style="margin: 28px 0; text-align: center; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600;">{{amount}} {{currency}}</p>
{{#if pay_url}}<p style="text-align: center;"><a href="{{pay_url}}">Pay the invoice</a></p>{{/if}}
<p>Your access continues while the invoice is paid within the grace period.</p>
